        "title": "Thuan ku dikho Poubaomei",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Thuan ku di kho poubaomei thuai hien liang mei,",
            "Kazauzian hei rui kanlou the;",
            "Rianra thei mei khou rui aniu ta kanlou,",
            "Ntau hei aniu gaina ariu dat the.",
            "",
            "He! Thuan dikho aniu kanlou mei pu,",
            "Kabang karuh thang tat man kanmei guay;",
            "Maan maknga ariu dat the Poubaomei zan khou,",
            "Thuan pui khuan rui kau kho halleluijah .",
            "",
            "2. Nchum mei Guangh Poubaomei khum ngai luai the,",
            "Neilapui tan guai ni luai the,",
            "Hei kum ma aniu ni tat man ngam khuan the,",
            "Ching le nzaeng kandi khou lung lik khuan the.",
            "",
            "3. Welcome bam khou hei aniu ariu dat the,",
            "Abanjat hei rui ham guang e;",
            "Khrita poubaomei khou nei la lou ngam o",
            "San gaipui tingmik e pou khrista zan khou.",
            "",
            "4. Neihla zaeng gaimei tei kathan pat dat diu,",
            "Lung lev bumaeng zip thau dat na;",
            "Aniu khang rui kapmei lev rian ra kanmei,",
            "Guangh khrista thuanku khang kathan sudat diu."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
